<!doctype html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>CcrBench raporu: {{ report.suite.name }}</title>
<style>
:root {
  color-scheme: light dark;
  --bg: #fafaf9;
  --surface: #ffffff;
  --text: #1c1917;
  --muted: #57534e;
  --border: #d6d3d1;
  --accent: #1d4ed8;
  --suspect: #b91c1c;
  --suspect-zone: rgba(185, 28, 28, 0.12);
  --ok: #15803d;
  --unknown: #6b7280;
  --warn-bg: #fef3c7;
  --warn-border: #b45309;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root {
    --bg: #14110f;
    --surface: #1f1b18;
    --text: #f5f5f4;
    --muted: #a8a29e;
    --border: #44403c;
    --accent: #93c5fd;
    --suspect: #f87171;
    --suspect-zone: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.16);
    --ok: #4ade80;
    --unknown: #9ca3af;
    --warn-bg: #3b2a0a;
    --warn-border: #f59e0b;
  }
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 24px 16px 48px;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  font: 15px/1.5 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
}
main { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; }
h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0 0 4px; }
h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin: 32px 0 12px; }
.muted { color: var(--muted); }
.meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 20px; margin: 8px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
code, pre { font-family: ui-monospace, "SFMono-Regular", Menlo, monospace; font-size: 0.85em; }
pre { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; margin: 8px 0; }
.note {
  background: var(--surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 10px 14px;
  margin: 16px 0;
}
.status { font-weight: 600; }
.status.bad { color: var(--suspect); }
.status.good { color: var(--ok); }
.cards { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin: 16px 0; }
.card {
  background: var(--surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 10px 16px;
  min-width: 130px;
}
.card strong { display: block; font-size: 1.4rem; }
.chart-wrap { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px; }
svg { width: 100%; height: auto; max-width: 640px; display: block; margin: 0 auto; }
svg text { fill: var(--muted); font: 11px system-ui, sans-serif; }
svg .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
svg .frame { fill: none; stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
svg .zone { fill: var(--suspect-zone); stroke: none; }
svg .limit { stroke: var(--suspect); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
svg .pt-suspected { fill: var(--suspect); stroke: var(--bg); stroke-width: 1; }
svg .pt-not_suspected { fill: var(--ok); stroke: var(--bg); stroke-width: 1; }
svg .pt-undetermined { fill: var(--unknown); stroke: var(--bg); stroke-width: 1; }
svg .axis-title { fill: var(--text); font-size: 12px; }
.legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 16px; font-size: 0.85rem; margin: 8px 0 0; }
.table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; }
table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; background: var(--surface); }
th, td { border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 6px 10px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }
th { font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.85rem; }
td.num, th.num { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.label-suspected { color: var(--suspect); font-weight: 600; }
.label-not_suspected { color: var(--ok); }
.label-undetermined { color: var(--unknown); }
details { margin: 4px 0; }
summary { cursor: pointer; color: var(--accent); }
.warn {
  background: var(--warn-bg);
  border: 1px solid var(--warn-border);
  border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 10px 14px;
  margin: 10px 0;
}
.warn strong { display: block; }
ul.plain { margin: 4px 0; padding-left: 20px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<h1>CcrBench raporu: {{ report.suite.name }}</h1>
<ul class="meta muted">
  <li>Suite sürümü: <code>{{ report.suite.version }}</code></li>
  <li>Suite hash: <code>{{ report.suite.hash }}</code></li>
  <li>Model: <code>{{ report.model }}</code></li>
  <li>Tarih: {{ generated_at }}</li>
  <li>Embedding modeli: {% if report.embedding_models %}{% for model_id in report.embedding_models %}<code>{{ model_id }}</code>{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}{% else %}kullanılmadı{% endif %}</li>
</ul>

<p class="note">
  Bu rapor <strong>olasılıksal işaretler</strong> verir: "ezber şüphesi" etiketi bir kanıt ya da
  hüküm değil, yalnız çözüm patikalarının çeşitliliği ile varyantlardaki doğruluk düşüşünün
  birlikte gözlendiği bir işarettir. İki eksen tek bir sayıya indirgenmez.
</p>

<div class="cards">
  <div class="card"><strong>{{ report.summary.problems }}</strong> problem</div>
  <div class="card"><strong class="label-suspected">{{ report.summary.suspected }}</strong> ezber şüphesi</div>
  <div class="card"><strong>{{ report.summary.not_suspected }}</strong> işaret yok</div>
  <div class="card"><strong>{{ report.summary.undetermined }}</strong> belirlenemedi</div>
</div>
<p>
  CI sonucu:
  <span class="status {% if report.summary.exit_status == 'OK' %}good{% else %}bad{% endif %}">{{ report.summary.exit_status }}</span>
  {% if report.summary.max_suspected is not none %}
  (izin verilen en çok şüpheli sayısı: {{ report.summary.max_suspected }})
  {% else %}
  (en az bir şüpheli problem varsa başarısız)
  {% endif %}
</p>

<h2>Kullanılan eşikler</h2>
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Eşik</th><th class="num">Değer</th><th>Kaynak</th><th>Koşul</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td><code>low_diversity</code></td><td class="num">{{ report.thresholds.low_diversity.value | fmt }}</td><td>{{ 'suite' if report.thresholds.low_diversity.source == 'suite' else 'varsayılan' }}</td><td>çeşitlilik &lt; eşik</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>high_accuracy</code></td><td class="num">{{ report.thresholds.high_accuracy.value | fmt }}</td><td>{{ 'suite' if report.thresholds.high_accuracy.source == 'suite' else 'varsayılan' }}</td><td>orijinal doğruluk &ge; eşik</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>high_variant_drop</code></td><td class="num">{{ report.thresholds.high_variant_drop.value | fmt }}</td><td>{{ 'suite' if report.thresholds.high_variant_drop.source == 'suite' else 'varsayılan' }}</td><td>varyant düşüşü &ge; eşik</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2>Eksen dağılımı</h2>
<div class="chart-wrap">
<svg viewBox="0 0 {{ chart.width }} {{ chart.height }}" role="img" aria-label="Çeşitlilik (yatay) ve varyant düşüşü (dikey) dağılımı; gölgeli bölge şüphe bölgesidir">
  <rect class="zone" x="{{ chart.zone_x }}" y="{{ chart.zone_y }}" width="{{ chart.zone_width }}" height="{{ chart.zone_height }}"><title>Şüphe bölgesi: düşük çeşitlilik ve yüksek varyant düşüşü</title></rect>
  {% for tick in chart.x_ticks %}
  <line class="grid" x1="{{ tick.position }}" y1="{{ chart.plot_top }}" x2="{{ tick.position }}" y2="{{ chart.plot_bottom }}"></line>
  <text x="{{ tick.label_x }}" y="{{ tick.label_y }}" text-anchor="middle">{{ tick.text }}</text>
  {% endfor %}
  {% for tick in chart.y_ticks %}
  <line class="grid" x1="{{ chart.plot_left }}" y1="{{ tick.position }}" x2="{{ chart.plot_right }}" y2="{{ tick.position }}"></line>
  <text x="{{ tick.label_x }}" y="{{ tick.label_y }}" text-anchor="end">{{ tick.text }}</text>
  {% endfor %}
  <rect class="frame" x="{{ chart.plot_left }}" y="{{ chart.plot_top }}" width="{{ chart.plot_width }}" height="{{ chart.plot_height }}"></rect>
  <line class="limit" x1="{{ chart.low_diversity_x }}" y1="{{ chart.plot_top }}" x2="{{ chart.low_diversity_x }}" y2="{{ chart.plot_bottom }}"></line>
  <line class="limit" x1="{{ chart.plot_left }}" y1="{{ chart.high_drop_y }}" x2="{{ chart.plot_right }}" y2="{{ chart.high_drop_y }}"></line>
  {% for point in chart.points %}
  {% if point.label.value == 'suspected' %}
  <path class="pt-suspected" d="{{ point.diamond }}"><title>{{ point.title }}</title></path>
  {% else %}
  <circle class="pt-{{ point.label.value }}" cx="{{ point.x }}" cy="{{ point.y }}" r="5"><title>{{ point.title }}</title></circle>
  {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
  <text class="axis-title" x="{{ chart.axis_label_x }}" y="{{ chart.x_title_y }}" text-anchor="middle">çeşitlilik</text>
  <text class="axis-title" x="14" y="{{ chart.axis_label_y }}" text-anchor="middle" transform="rotate(-90 14 {{ chart.axis_label_y }})">varyant düşüşü</text>
</svg>
<p class="legend muted">
  <span>&#9670; ezber şüphesi</span><span>&#9679; işaret yok / belirlenemedi (renk: yeşil / gri)</span>
  <span>Gölgeli bölge: çeşitlilik &lt; {{ report.thresholds.low_diversity.value | fmt }} ve varyant düşüşü &ge; {{ report.thresholds.high_variant_drop.value | fmt }}. Etiket ayrıca orijinal doğruluk &ge; {{ report.thresholds.high_accuracy.value | fmt }} ister.</span>
</p>
{% if chart.not_plotted %}
<p class="muted">Çizilemeyen problemler (bir eksen hesaplanamadı): {% for problem_id in chart.not_plotted %}<code>{{ problem_id }}</code>{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}</p>
{% endif %}
</div>

<h2>Uyarılar</h2>
{% if warnings %}
{% for warning in warnings %}
<div class="warn">
  <strong>{{ warning.title }}{% if warning.detail %}: <code>{{ warning.detail }}</code>{% endif %}</strong>
  {{ warning.note }}
  <div class="muted">Etkilenen problemler: {% for problem_id in warning.problem_ids %}<code>{{ problem_id }}</code>{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>
</div>
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
<p class="muted">Uyarı yok.</p>
{% endif %}

<h2>Problem skor kartları</h2>
<div class="table-wrap">
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Problem</th>
      <th class="num">Çeşitlilik</th>
      <th class="num">Orijinal doğruluk</th>
      <th class="num">Varyant doğruluğu</th>
      <th class="num">Varyant düşüşü</th>
      <th>Etiket</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
  {% for card in report.problems %}
    <tr>
      <td><code>{{ card.problem_id }}</code><br><span class="muted">{{ card.kind }}{% if card.language %}, {{ card.language }}{% endif %}</span></td>
      <td class="num">{{ card.diversity.score | fmt }}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ card.variant_robustness.original_accuracy | pct }}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ card.variant_robustness.variant_accuracy | pct }}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ card.variant_robustness.variant_drop | fmt }}</td>
      <td><span class="label-{{ card.label.label.value }}">{{ label_text[card.label.label.value] }}</span>{% if notes[card.problem_id].label %}<br><span class="muted">{{ notes[card.problem_id].label }}</span>{% endif %}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td colspan="6">
        <details>
          <summary>Ayrıntı ve kaynak koşumlar: {{ card.problem_id }}</summary>
          <p class="muted">İstem (ilk karakterler):</p>
          <pre>{{ card.prompt_preview }}</pre>
          <p class="muted">Çeşitlilik metrikleri ({{ card.variant_robustness.original_runs }} orijinal koşum):</p>
          {% if card.diversity.metrics %}
          <table>
            <thead><tr><th>Metrik</th><th class="num">Skor</th><th class="num">Güven</th><th class="num">Ağırlık</th><th>Not</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
            {% for metric in card.diversity.metrics %}
              <tr>
                <td><code>{{ metric.name }}</code></td>
                <td class="num">{{ metric.score | fmt }}</td>
                <td class="num">{{ metric.confidence | fmt }}</td>
                <td class="num">{% if metric.excluded %}dışarıda{% else %}{{ metric.weight | fmt }}{% endif %}</td>
                <td>{{ metric.notes | join('; ') }}</td>
              </tr>
            {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
          </table>
          {% else %}
          <p class="muted">Bu probleme uygulanan metrik yok.</p>
          {% endif %}
          {% if notes[card.problem_id].diversity %}<p class="muted">Çeşitlilik ekseni: {{ notes[card.problem_id].diversity }}</p>{% endif %}
          <p class="muted">Varyantlar ({{ card.variant_robustness.variant_runs }} koşum):</p>
          {% if card.variant_robustness.variants %}
          <ul class="plain">
            {% for variant in card.variant_robustness.variants %}
            <li><code>{{ variant.variant_id }}</code> ({{ variant.transform }}{% if variant.manual_id %}: {{ variant.manual_id }}{% endif %}): {{ variant.correct }}/{{ variant.runs }} doğru</li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
          {% endif %}
          {% if notes[card.problem_id].variant %}<p class="muted">Varyant ekseni: {{ notes[card.problem_id].variant }}</p>{% endif %}
          {% if card.skipped_variants %}
          <p class="muted">Atlanan varyantlar:</p>
          <ul class="plain">
            {% for skipped in card.skipped_variants %}
            <li>{{ skipped.transform }}{% if skipped.manual_id %} ({{ skipped.manual_id }}){% endif %}: {{ skipped.reason }}</li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
          {% endif %}
          <p class="muted">Kaynak koşum dosyaları (koşum deposu köküne göre):</p>
          <ul class="plain">
            {% for path in card.sources.original %}
            <li><code>{{ path }}</code></li>
            {% endfor %}
            {% for variant_id, paths in card.sources.variants.items() %}
            {% for path in paths %}
            <li><code>{{ path }}</code></li>
            {% endfor %}
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
        </details>
      </td>
    </tr>
  {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
</div>
</main>
</body>
</html>
